2477 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Where is VAE in the Generative Trilemma\077\nVAE generation is fast\072 one decoder network inference\073\nDecoder should cover all data modes by design \050via reconstruction of the dataset\051\073\nIndividual samples\054 however\054 are not always good\056\n\nThe encoder\220s problem is hard\056 It is typically the source of quality degradation\072\nIf encoder merges different latents\054 decoder performs averaging\073\nGood decoder \053 encoder\054 unable to produce Gaussian distribution \075 poor samples at generation \050same problem as in AEs\051\056)
